cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "AlphaCOGANT: Recursive Corporate Self-Improvement as Active Inference"
abstract: >-
  An illustrative reduced Active Inference model inspired by the AlphaFund
  recursive-self-improvement whitepaper. Five hidden capability factors have
  fixed matrices, one-step Expected Free Energy scores, and a separately
  evaluated paired synthetic create-minus-decay diagnostic. Model-result
  manuscript numerics are generated by a tested NumPy engine; no calibrated
  financial performance or enforced model-update gate is claimed.
